**Success:** zero fallback chains in `web/src/repositories/`; every web path appears
verbatim in the KMP constant list; `npm run build && npm test` green.

**Tech-debt watch:** step 6 adds an error state to every consuming ViewModel —
finish all of them this phase, not just OIR.

